1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:03,279
Trigunaï Innovations is an early-stage deep-tech company

2
00:00:03,279 --> 00:00:07,120
building the connective tissue of physical AI for visual capture.

3
00:00:07,120 --> 00:00:11,199
We combine motion-capture data, reinforcement learning,
and VR validation

4
00:00:11,199 --> 00:00:15,214
to train autonomous camera policies —
software cinematographers

5
00:00:15,214 --> 00:00:18,414
that learn from data and deploy to real hardware.

6
00:00:18,414 --> 00:00:21,993
Our current focus is dance, performance,
and live event cinematography.

7
00:00:22,053 --> 00:00:25,653
We work with mocap libraries, train custom policies,

8
00:00:25,653 --> 00:00:28,233
and deliver them in formats that drop into
both creative pipelines and drone hardware.
